# Gas Risk Classification

| Gas Average | Risk Level |
|-------------|------------|
| < 2100 | SAFE |
| 2100 – 2599 | WARNING |
| ≥ 2600 | DANGER |

---

# Fever Detection

If the body temperature is greater than or equal to **32.5°C**, the fever flag is set.

```
Body Temperature >= 32.5°C
fever_flag = 1

Otherwise

fever_flag = 0
```

---

# Data Packet

The ESP32 sends the following JSON data:

```json
{
    "gas_avg": 2250,
    "risk_level": "WARNING",
    "body_temp": 33.4,
    "fever_flag": 1,
    "room_temp": 29.8,
    "pressure": 1007.5,
    "altitude": 34.2,
    "timestamp": "2026-06-28 14:30:12"
}
```

